<title>SWITZERLAND: Novartis says Alzheimer drug gets okay.</title>
<headline>Novartis says Alzheimer drug gets okay.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novartis said its new medicine Exelon for treatment of Alzheimer's disease had been approved for marketing in Switzerland, the first clearance for the drug by a regulatory body.</p>
<p>Novartis said Exelon was approved by Swiss authorities for treatment of mild to moderately severe Alzheimer's based on a clinical study program conducted among over 3,330 patients in Europe and North America.</p>
